    <article class="post__paper" lang="en">
      <h2>WHAT IS THE PERIODIC TABLE?</h2>
      <p>THE PERIODIC TABLE IS A TABLE THAT SHOWS ALL THE ELEMENTS AND WHAT ELEMENTS NUMBER THEY ARE.</p>

      <h2>WHY I CHOSE TO PRESENT THE PERIODIC TABLE:</h2>
      <p>BECAUSE I THOUGHT IT WAS UNIQUE NO ONE WAS DOING AND BECAUSE I NEED TO REMEBER WHAT ELEMENTS WERE WHAT SO I DECIDED TO DO SOMETHING I FOUND DIFFICULT.</p>

      <h2>HOW I MADE IT:</h2>
      <p>FIRST OF ALL I NEEDED A BIG PIECE OF CARDBOARD TO MAKE THE BASE OF THE PROJECT. THEN I MIXED SOME DIFFERENT PAINTS EXPIEREMENTING WITH THE COLORS BUT NOT MIXING THEM FULLY TO MAKE A NICE EFFECT. THEN I MADE A SIGN OUT OF PAPER AND CARDBOARD, AND THEN I MADE A CUTE FRAME OUT OF CLAY AND BOWS.</p>

      <h2>ABOUT ART OF SCIENCE CLASS:</h2>
      <p>IN ART OF SCIENCE CLASS, OUR TEACHER IS MR SETH. WE MAKE DIFFERENT ROJECTS DEPENDING ON WHAT WE ARE LEARNING IN SIENCE CLASS. MY CLASS HAS MADE MANY PROJECTS INCLUDING A DIAGRAM OF A CELL, WATER CYCLE, SOLAR SYSTEM, VOLCANO, ROBAT AND HAVE DONE SOME EXPIERIMENT.</p>
    </article>

